  <line id="tr_1_tl_46">videmus. Dicitur autem hic modus</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_47">subhastatio: quia prisco tempore in pu¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_48">blicum forum res ea necessitate venden¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_49">dae inferebantur, &amp; hasta, ibi erigebatur,</line>
