  <line id="tr_1_tl_51">tioni, &amp; auctionibus contendentium eme¬</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_52">re. Quando autem hasta illa tollebatur,</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_53">tunc licitationi, &amp; auctioni iam locus</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_54">non erat, sed contractus perficiebatur.</line>
  <line id="tr_1_tl_55">cum eo, qui plus precium auxerat, &amp;</line>
